<title>LEBANON: Lebanon issues year-to-date debt figures.</title>
<headline>Lebanon issues year-to-date debt figures.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's finance ministry issued the following public debt figures to the end of October (in billions of dollars unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>	    Net Domestic    Net Domestic   Foreign debt   Total</p>
<p>	   Debt (LBP blns)	Debt</p>
<p> Jan	   9,614		 6,041	   1,305	 7,346</p>
<p> Feb	  10,032		 6,317	   1,333	 7,650</p>
<p> Mar	  10,238		 6,465	   1,360	 7,825</p>
<p> Apr	  10,668		 6,752	   1,388	 8,140</p>
<p> May	  10,939		 6,945	   1,519	 8,464</p>
<p> Jun	  11,236		 7,152	   1,573	 8,725</p>
<p> Jul	  11,676		 7,454	   1,568	 9,022</p>
<p> Aug	  11,961		 7,657	   1,596	 9,253</p>
<p> Sep	  12,434		 7,978	   1,646	 9,624</p>
<p> Oct	  12,743		 8,190	   1,636	 9,826</p>
<p>($1 = 1,555 Lebanese pounds</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
</text>
